{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"88dfe968124b22760b2021a1ff05966bca10f085ce6d6eeba0253dacf63dd9ff","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["信的人得享安息"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["因此，上帝既然仍旧应许我们进入祂的安息，我们就该心存敬畏，免得有人得不到这福分。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为我们和他们一样听到了福音，只是他们听了道后没有凭信心领受，结果没有得到益处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["正如上帝曾说：",{"text":"“因此我愤然起誓说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘他们绝不可进入我的安息。’","poem":1},{"noteId":14},{"text":"”","poem":1},"但我们这些已经信的人能够进入祂的安息。其实造物之工自创世以来就已经完成了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为圣经谈到第七日时说：“第七日，上帝歇了一切的工。”",{"noteId":15}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["经文又说：“他们绝不可进入我的安息。”",{"noteId":16}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["既然最终会有人进入祂的安息，而那些从前听过福音的人因为不信没能进去，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["上帝就另定了一个日子，即多年后借大卫所说的“今日”",{"noteId":17},"，正如前面所引用的经文：",{"text":"“你们今日若听见祂的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可心里顽固。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["如果当初约书亚已经让他们得到了安息，上帝就不必另定一个日子了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这样说来，必定另有一个安息日为上帝的子民存留，使他们可以真正安歇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因为人进入上帝的安息，也是歇了自己的工作，好像上帝歇了祂的工作一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因此，我们要竭力进入那安息，免得像他们一样因不顺服而倒毙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["上帝的话有生命、有功效，锋利无比，胜过一切两刃的利剑，甚至能够剌入并分开魂与灵、关节与骨髓，辨明人一切的思想和动机。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["任何受造物在上帝面前都无法隐藏，因为万物都赤裸裸地显露在上帝眼前，我们必须向祂交账。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["大祭司耶稣"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我们既然有一位已经升上高天的尊贵大祭司——上帝的儿子耶稣，就应当持守我们所认定的信仰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["因为我们这位大祭司并非不能体恤我们的软弱，祂与我们一样曾经面对各种试探，却从来没有犯罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["所以，让我们坦然无惧地到祂赐恩的宝座前，好领受怜悯和恩典，作随时的帮助。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇95:11。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":3}},{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"创世记2:2。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":4}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇95:11。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":5}},{"noteId":17,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇95:7、8。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}